[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m So, the prime factorization is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m 9! = 2^7 \times 3^4 \times 5^1 \times 7^1
