[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m - $ a = 4, b = 1 $: $ 3^4 \cdot 7 = 567 $ → ends in 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m Now, only the numbers ending in 1 are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=232324)[0m 
